resolved_issues.body:
Create functionality to add domain together with a plan via `me/shopping-cart/siteID` endpoint.

We can pass a plan and a domain objects to a `products` parameter in this format:

```
products: [
    {
      product_id: 1003
    },
    {
      product_id: 6
      meta: "someDomain.com"
    },
]
```

See iOS issue for more details: https://github.com/wordpress-mobile/WordPress-iOS/issues/21636

problem_statement:
Plans in Site Creation: Create functionality to add domain with a plan to a cart
Create functionality to add domain together with a plan via `me/shopping-cart/siteID` endpoint.

We can pass a plan and a domain objects to a `products` parameter in this format:

```
products: [
    {
      product_id: 1003
    },
    {
      product_id: 6
      meta: "someDomain.com"
    },
]
```

See iOS issue for more details: https://github.com/wordpress-mobile/WordPress-iOS/issues/21636

